clevofan-dkms (1.1+diamon1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Repackage this fork as clevofan-dkms via dh_dkms (--with dkms),
    replacing Juno's hand-rolled postinst/prerm (cp into /usr/src, raw
    dkms add/install/remove) and its unserialized EC port I/O.
  * Fixes the V5xTNC_TND_TNE second fan: control index 2, tach
    0xD2/0xD3, folded into the generic per-model table instead of a
    one-off special case (Juno 0.4.0-2 maps it to index 4, 0xD4/0xD5).
  * Serializes every EC access through ec_transaction(), so this driver
    no longer races the ACPI EC driver's own port I/O.

 -- Marco Barbone <mbarbone@flatironinstitute.org>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 13:11:12 -0400
